                <div class="ht-ftype__faq-a" hidden>Frosted decorative film inherently diffuses some solar heat, but it's not a substitute for dedicated solar control film. For glass that needs both decorative effect and solar control performance, we can combine a solar control base layer with a decorative top layer, or specify hybrid films that deliver both. We'll walk through the options during the site visit.</div>
